+            # TODO: convergence check — per Φπε proofs, ε-convergence
+            # (micro-ignition settling below threshold) is the natural
+            # loop-exit criterion, replacing the fixed 10-iteration cap.
         return result
 
     # ===== OPERATOR IMPLEMENTATIONS =====
